title: 'remote-build.py can silently produce a stale baseline binary: run from a lane worktree, the master build is the pre-rebase artefact, and the sweep guard cannot see it because base != fixed is still true'
updated_at: "2026-08-31T17:17:42Z"
---

remote-build.py can silently produce a stale baseline binary: run from a lane worktree, the master build is the pre-rebase artefact, and the sweep guard cannot see it because base != fixed is still true
